Cell["\<\
There is one hAAA contact and three gauge-field exchanges in the s, t and u \
channels. All four contributions are required for the gauge-field Ward \
identities. Their common coupling order is g\:209b \[Kappa]. The model cutoff \
is \[Kappa]\.b2 per vertex; it is not a cutoff on the total order of an \
arbitrary diagram.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e5eac29d-329e-444b-988c-d8a0b7025c82"],

