Cell["All diagrams carry the same antisymmetric colour factor. Display its \
multiplier separately to keep the result readable. Factoring the exact \
rational expression introduces no additional kinematic or helicity \
assumption; the equalities are understood away from propagator poles. The \
next output is the kinematic multiplier \|01d4a6 = \[ScriptCapitalM]/(g\:209b \
\[Kappa] f\:1d43\:1d47\:1d9c); no colour sum is performed.", "Text", 
   ExpressionUUID -> "11687593-ea0f-45aa-9dcf-47e572b9f817"],

Cell[TextData[{Cell[BoxData[FormBox[RowBox[{"\[ScriptCapitalM]", "=", 
          SubscriptBox["g", "s"], " ", "\[Kappa]", " ", SuperscriptBox["f", 
           "abc"], " ", "\[ScriptCapitalK]"}], TraditionalForm]], 
      "InlineFormula"]}], "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
    "082c7eb8-acfc-4420-8c26-404190c2eaaa"],

